    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">rotational constant</rdfs:label>
    <schema:description xml:lang="en">scale of rotational energies in molecular spectroscopy</schema:description>
    <mathmoddb:P1459 xml:lang="en">In rotational spectroscopy, the energy levels of a molecule are often given in terms of its rotational constant which is inversely proportional to the moment of inertia.</mathmoddb:P1459>
    <mathmoddb:P1690 xml:lang="en">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rigid_rotor#Quantum_mechanical_linear_rigid_rotor</mathmoddb:P1690>
