    <mathmoddb:P558 xml:lang="en">https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6482447</mathmoddb:P558>
    <mathmoddb:P1459 xml:lang="en">Numerical solution of a Lyapunov equation via Zhou and Sorensen 2-solve method, implemented as part of the Matrix Equation Sparse Solver (M.E.S.S.) project. Copyright 2009–2022 Jens Saak, Martin Koehler, Peter Benner and others.</mathmoddb:P1459>
